note Drag a graph node by its title (or its body) to move it; the node stays where it was dropped from then on, while the rest keeps the automatic layout. Pressing on the title also selects the node: its step if it is one, otherwise its symbol, without re-centring the camera. 'auto layout' drops every dragged position.

